    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Journey Never Ends: Leviathan</strong> is a mature, turn-based RPG set in the dystopian mega-city of <strong>Leviathan</strong>\u2014a vast, oppressive world where survival is a daily struggle and morality is a luxury. Ruled by the godlike machine entity <strong>Kelzik</strong> and the corporate empire, <strong>Seven Virtues</strong>, none can fight back against their insurmountable might.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dark, atmospheric experience, your journey isn't just about saving the world\u2014it's about not losing yourself to it. Scavenge, fight, and do whatever you can to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring turn-based combat, deep characters, and a narrative that challenges the ethics of the main cast at every turn, <strong>The Journey Never Ends: Leviathan</strong> invites you to carve out a life in a city that wants to consume you whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A main story that lasts around 25-30 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bunch of side quests\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of post game content including a roguelike bonus dungeon that's different every time you enter it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bonus chapter that offers a more elaborate epilogue for those looking for even more story</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Journey Never Ends: Leviathan</strong> is a mature, turn-based RPG set in the dystopian mega-city of <strong>Leviathan</strong>\u2014a vast, oppressive world where survival is a daily struggle and morality is a luxury. Ruled by the godlike machine entity <strong>Kelzik</strong> and the corporate empire, <strong>Seven Virtues</strong>, none can fight back against their insurmountable might.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dark, atmospheric experience, your journey isn't just about saving the world\u2014it's about not losing yourself to it. Scavenge, fight, and do whatever you can to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring turn-based combat, deep characters, and a narrative that challenges the ethics of the main cast at every turn, <strong>The Journey Never Ends: Leviathan</strong> invites you to carve out a life in a city that wants to consume you whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A main story that lasts around 25-30 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bunch of side quests\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of post game content including a roguelike bonus dungeon that's different every time you enter it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bonus chapter that offers a more elaborate epilogue for those looking for even more story</p></li></ul>",
